OL,3,GNEWSAMedic struck off for kissing and
OL,4,Atouching colleagues
OL,5,
OL,6,FA medic has been struck off for kissing
OL,7,Fand touching his female colleagues as
OL,8,Fthey tried to care for patients.
OL,10,FStephen Spencer, an operating
OL,11,Fdepartment practitioner at Wrightington
OL,12,FHospital in Appley Bridge, was
OL,13,Fdescribed as "leery" by one colleague
OL,14,Fand left another feeling "violated and
OL,15,Fintimidated".
OL,17,FWhen questioned by his managers he told
OL,18,Fthem the allegations had been "bang out
OL,19,Fof order" and added: "I'm old school
OL,20,Fand will always help women."
